<title>ITALY: Bologna air cargo traffic April 97.</title>
<headline>Bologna air cargo traffic April 97.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total cargo traffic at Bologna airport rose 12.6 percent in April 1997 to 1,291 tonnes against the same period 1996, Bologna airport authority said.</p>
<p>			   Apr 97    Pct change	  Jan-Apr 97 Pct change</p>
<p>			  (tonnes)   against Apr 96    (tonnes)   vs Jan-Apr 96</p>
<p>Cargo Flown		 854     up  9.9		  3,143   up 20.7</p>
<p>via truck		   437     up 18.2		  1,656 down 11.7</p>
<p>Total Traffic	   1,291     up 12.6		  5,604   up  8.1</p>
<p>Total mail		  248     up 13.4		    968  down 2.7</p>
<p>Total Passengers    218,338     up 16.0		708,723   up 16.0</p>
<p>--Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
